    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, an aneurysm?? That sounds terrifying. I've never had anything like that happen before, it just feels like my usual migraine but way more intense. Are you sure it's not just a migraine flare up? Also, I already have some ibuprofen in my cabinet, can I just take a few of those instead of the aspirin thing you mentioned? I really don't want to go to the ER if I don't have to, it's so expensive and the wait is always hours.",
