      "content": "idk i'm just so scared to go to the hospital. is there really no way to tell the difference at home? like what if i just take some extra strong acetaminophen and lay down in a dark room for an hour to see if it passes? if the pain starts to fade even a little bit, does that mean it's just a migraine and i don't need to go?",
